top: tiny8_cpu
description: >
  Tiny8 8-bit stored-program educational CPU for the native PICADS compiler.
  CO module regions are architectural guides only; actual ALU, memory and control
  placement fencing requires a future compiler/backend capability.
modules:
  - name: Tiny8Processor
    function: tiny8_cpu
    purpose: >
      Execute commands, fetch and decode instructions, operate on the 8-bit ALU,
      access the 16 x 8-bit scratchpad and update PC/accumulator/output status.
